OL,3,ADad's house rammed before son died in
OL,4,AA66 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA house rammed by a car before the
OL,7,Ffatal A66 crash in Middlesbrough
OL,8,Fbelonged to the father of a teenager
OL,9,Fwho died in the incident.
OL,11,FCole Worthy was one of five young men
OL,12,Fin a Volkswagen Passat travelling the
OL,13,Fwrong way down the A66 who were killed
OL,14,Fwhen it hit a Cleveland Police armed
OL,15,Fresponse vehicle in the early hours of
OL,16,FSaturday, also killing two police
OL,17,Fofficers.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
